{
 "_help": "Active skills and support modifiers (Path of Exile style). Skill: kind (projectile, nova, chain, heal, zone, strike, melee, spin, leap, dash, buff), tags (supports require one matching tag), type (damage type), mp/st cost, cd, cast (s), scale ('spell' = dmg + lvl*level times spell power; 'weapon' = mult x weapon damage), radius, speed, count, spread (deg), pierce, chain, homing, dur, tick, heal (fraction of max health), status {id: [chance, duration multiplier, power (0 = default)]}, knock, stun, up (knock-up), arc (deg), range, delay, buff {stat: value}, req (character level), cost (rank points to unlock). Ranks: each rank after the first adds rankP % damage and one more support socket every two ranks (max 3). Support: every support fits every skill and all of them combine (tags only place it in the modifier tree). cost, req, mods: dmgP, aoeP, projSpeedP, projCount, homing, pierce, chain, echo (stacks, up to 3 repeats), auto ('timer', 'hit' or 'crit'; several triggers each fire), autoCd, costP, cdP, castP, stun, knockP, up, leech, execute, critC (crit chance %), durP (duration %), tickP (zone tick interval %), healP (heal %), selfHeal (% max health on use), manaBack (% of cost refunded on use), convert (damage type; the last one socketed wins), status {id: [chance, durMul, pow]}.",
